@startuml
title Q6 - Classes (1/2) : modules, donnees et responsabilites
top to bottom direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 20
hide empty members
class MultitaskingAccumulator {
  + main(): int
}
interface IAcquisitionManager
class AcquisitionManager {
  - producers[4]: pthread_t
  - inputIds[4]: unsigned int
  - buffer[4]: MSG_BLOCK
  - states[4]: SlotState
  - freeIndices, readyIndices: indices[4]
  - A, D, createdThreads: unsigned int
  - closed, aborted: bool
  - mAcq: pthread_mutex_t
  - cvFree, cvReady: pthread_cond_t
  - produce(inputId): void*
  - reserveSlot(): index/status
  - publishSlot(index): void
  - incrementProducerCount(): void
  + acquisitionManagerInit(): InitStatus
  + acquisitionManagerJoin(): void
  + acquisitionManagerClose(): void
  + acquisitionManagerAbort(): void
  + acquisitionManagerDestroy(): void
}
interface IMessageAdder
class MessageAdder {
  - consumer: pthread_t
  - workingSum: MSG_BLOCK [prive]
  - currentSum: MSG_BLOCK [partage]
  - S, R: unsigned int
  - full, closed, aborted: bool
  - diagnosticEnCours: bool
  - mAdder: pthread_mutex_t
  - cvDisplay, cvCommit: pthread_cond_t
  - sum(): void*
  - publishSum(sum): CommitStatus
  - commitRejection(): CommitStatus
  - closePublications(): void
  + messageAdderInit(): InitStatus
  + messageAdderJoin(): void
  + messageAdderAbort(): void
  + messageAdderDestroy(): void
}
class DisplayManager {
  - displayThread: pthread_t
  - L: unsigned int [prive]
  - hasDisplayed: bool [prive]
  - nextDeadline: timespec [prive]
  - display(): void*
  - emitPublication(pub): void
  - emitDiagnostic(final): CaptureStatus
  + displayManagerInit(): InitStatus
  + displayManagerJoin(): void
  + displayManagerDestroy(): void
}
interface ISensor
interface IDisplay
class Msg
MultitaskingAccumulator *-- AcquisitionManager
MultitaskingAccumulator *-- MessageAdder
MultitaskingAccumulator *-- DisplayManager
AcquisitionManager ..|> IAcquisitionManager
MessageAdder ..|> IMessageAdder
MessageAdder ..> IAcquisitionManager : recoit
DisplayManager ..> IAcquisitionManager : lit A
DisplayManager ..> IMessageAdder : recoit / capture
AcquisitionManager ..> ISensor : utilise
MessageAdder ..> Msg : utilise
DisplayManager ..> IDisplay : utilise
legend bottom
  Architecture cible; les sources C et les en-tetes restent au stade squelette (Q4).
  Initialement A=D=S=R=L=0, cumul nul; 4 cases libres, publication vide.
  closed=aborted=diagnosticEnCours=hasDisplayed=false.
  Mutex libres, conditions initialisees; aucun semaphore; cvDisplay MONOTONIC.
  Les interfaces et types de retour sont detailles dans le volet classes 2/2.
endlegend
@enduml

@startuml multitaskingAccumulatorClassInterfaces
title Q6 - Classes (2/2) : interfaces et types de conception
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
interface IAcquisitionManager {
  + getMessage(out): InputStatus
  + getProducedCount(): unsigned int
  + getProducerCount(): unsigned int
}
interface IMessageAdder {
  + nextDisplayEvent(deadline, out): DisplayEvent
  + beginDiagnostic(out): CaptureStatus
  + endDiagnostic(): void
  + getCurrentSum(): MSG_BLOCK
  + getConsumedCount(): unsigned int
}
interface ISensor {
  + getInput(input, block): void
}
interface IDisplay {
  + messageDisplay(block): void
  + print(produced, consumed: unsigned int): void
}
class Msg <<fourni>> {
  + messageCheck(block): unsigned int
  + messageAdd(src, add): void
}
class MSG_BLOCK <<fourni>> {
  checksum: unsigned int
  mData[256]: unsigned int
}
class Publication <<copie privee>> {
  sum: MSG_BLOCK
  version: unsigned int
}
class DiagnosticCapture <<copie privee>> {
  S, R: unsigned int
  hasPending: bool
  pending: Publication
}
IAcquisitionManager -[hidden]right-> IMessageAdder
IAcquisitionManager -[hidden]down-> ISensor
ISensor -[hidden]down-> Msg
IMessageAdder -[hidden]down-> IDisplay
IMessageAdder ..> DiagnosticCapture
IMessageAdder ..> Publication
DiagnosticCapture ..> Publication
Publication ..> MSG_BLOCK
legend bottom
  AM fournit IAcquisitionManager; MA fournit IMessageAdder; DM utilise les deux.
  block/src/add: volatile MSG_BLOCK*; input/produced/consumed: unsigned int.
  ISensor et IDisplay sont fournis par les bibliotheques externes, utilisees par AM/DM.
  getMessage(out: MSG_BLOCK*); nextDisplayEvent(deadline: timespec, out: Publication*).
  beginDiagnostic(out: DiagnosticCapture*); copie et retrait atomiques sous mAdder.
  begin/end verrouillent et deverrouillent en interne: aucun mutex detenu entre eux.
  InputStatus={MESSAGE,END,ABORT}; DisplayEvent={PUBLICATION,DIAGNOSTIC_DUE,END,ABORT}.
  InitStatus={OK,ERROR}; CaptureStatus/CommitStatus={OK,ABORT}.
  SlotState={LIBRE,RESERVEE,PRETE,EN_LECTURE}; alias getProducerCount=getProducedCount.
  getCurrentSum = cumul courant; getConsumedCount = T=S+R (messages traites), sous mAdder.
  Getters isoles synchronises, non composes pour fabriquer le diagnostic (S,R de la capture; A lu une fois).
endlegend
@enduml
